Date: Mon, 30 Mar 2026 18:09:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/20] fix: Update PONN GGML backend interfaces and ops

Adds inference-aware dtype selection.
Fixes stride types for non-contiguous copies/get-rows, updates RoPE to
support the new API.

Bug: #510467

From: kylin

Severity: Critical

Tested-by: luyuhong <luyuhong@kylinos.cn>
Change-Id: I9855eb6746c78e144f8536741229ae00ee4019aa
